  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Improved Water, Sanitation and Hygiene in Rural Areas of Zimbabwe - Monitoring and Evaluation  is a component of Support to improved water and sanitation in rural areas - Zimbabwe reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;135,216. It works in the following sector(s): Basic sanitation, Education and training in water supply and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
